Comment: Artwork proposal for Debian 14 "forky".
 All the artwork is generated by build.py from the files below, and none of
 it is kept in the repository. Generated files carry the terms of the files
 they are made from; most of them also contain the Debian Open Use Logo (see
 its paragraph below).

